# Gurmag Nightwatch ({2/B}{2/G}{2/U}, paid with three Moxen) looks at the top three cards when it enters. Bot1 puts the
# Forest, the last of the three, back on top and the Lightning Bolt and Ponder go to the graveyard; on turn 3 the Forest is the
# card drawn. Two cards back on top, or a shuffle, are refused: only one may be put back and nothing is shuffled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gurmag Nightwatch
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Island x3
Lightning Bolt
Ponder
Forest
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gurmag Nightwatch.Cast
! Bot1.Arrange(Forest; Ponder | Lightning Bolt)
! Bot1.Arrange(Shuffle)
Bot1.Arrange(Forest | Lightning Bolt; Ponder)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Ponder; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Forest
Bot1.Battlefield = Gurmag Nightwatch; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
